WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:07,920
There is still a bit of a gap in physical fitness.

2
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,720
It's almost noon

3
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:10,920
Let’s set up camp first

4
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:22,380
Are you students using their hair as fish ears? Lao Zhang walked over so early.

5
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:23,480
Oh no matter who wins

6
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,470
There will always be someone out there to pick you up early.

7
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:28,320
Can you send the children back early?

8
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,320
Zhang Laila set up camp a little late today

9
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:34,830
Why does the tent next to her look so familiar?

10
00:00:35,030 --> 00:00:36,430
Just a mecha room

11
00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:37,830
Even if you reach out, it's okay

12
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:40,230
It definitely can’t be compared with an A-level half-life soldier.

13
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:42,220
After watching it for so many days

14
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:44,420
The three students in the S version are still very principled

15
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:45,620
Don't mess with their people

16
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:47,020
They won't take the initiative

17
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,280
Version A does not have a hunting atmosphere

18
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:50,680
Laila won't touch him

19
00:00:51,730 --> 00:00:53,930
But why do I always have an ominous premonition?
